A ring of conflict is fun!  Here's the _story_:
I was on this one level and there were about 600000000000 ghosts,
&'s, W's, Z's and other reasonably dead things in this one room.
I slipped on the ring of conflict and everyone attacked everyone
else... It took *hours* to cross the room...


This has the added benefit of actually *killing* some of the things
off easily (ever seen an & attack a giant bat?

MY QUESTION now centers on:  has anyone ever completed the game without
using the X exploration mode?  I don't think it's possible ...
even if you begin with a wand of wishes -- I wished for the 
"blessed scroll of recharging" and all it gave me was one wish more :-)
I always think a wand of death is a good thing to wish for...

My tip is: fire off your wands at an *angle* to you -- there is a much
smaller chance of hitting yourself.
